Package: oobase58
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: BASE58 ENCODER
 Cryptographic Base58 encoder and decoder omitting ambiguous alphanumeric glyphs.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
